#: ../../source/changelogs/v4.2.2.rst:2
msgid "Version 4.2.2"
msgstr "버전 4.2.2"

#: ../../source/changelogs/v4.2.2.rst:4
msgid "Release Date: August 6, 2022"
msgstr "릴리즈 날짜: 2022년 8월 6일"

#: ../../source/changelogs/v4.2.2.rst:6
msgid "**4.2.2 release of CodeIgniter4**"
msgstr "**CodeIgniter4\ 의 4.2.2 릴리즈**"

#: ../../source/changelogs/v4.2.2.rst:13
msgid "BREAKING"
msgstr "주요 변경사항"

#: ../../source/changelogs/v4.2.2.rst:15
msgid "Now ``Services::request()`` returns ``IncomingRequest`` or ``CLIRequest``."
msgstr "이제 ``Services::request()``\ 가 ``IncomingRequest`` 또는 ``CLIRequest``\ 를 반환합니다."

#: ../../source/changelogs/v4.2.2.rst:16
msgid ""
"The method signature of ``CodeIgniter\\Debug\\Exceptions::__construct()``"
" has been changed. The ``IncomingRequest`` typehint on the ``$request`` "
"parameter was removed. Extending classes should likewise remove the "
"parameter so as not to break LSP."
msgstr ""
"``CodeIgniter\\Debug\\Exceptions::__construct()``\ 의 메서드 시그니처가 변경되었습니다. "
"``$request`` 파라미터의 ``IncomingRequest`` 타입 힌트가 제거되었습니다. "
"확장 클래스도 LSP를 위반하지 않도록 파라미터를 제거해야 합니다."

#: ../../source/changelogs/v4.2.2.rst:17
msgid ""
"The method signature of ``BaseBuilder.php::insert()`` and "
"``BaseBuilder.php::update()`` have been changed. The ``?array`` typehint "
"on the ``$set`` parameter was removed."
msgstr ""
"``BaseBuilder.php::insert()``\ 와 ``BaseBuilder.php::update()``\ 의 메서드 시그니처가 변경되었습니다. "
"``$set`` 파라미터의 ``?array`` 타입 힌트가 제거되었습니다."

#: ../../source/changelogs/v4.2.2.rst:18
msgid ""
"A bug that caused pages to be cached before after filters were executed "
"when using page caching has been fixed. Adding response headers or "
"changing the response body in after filters now caches them correctly."
msgstr ""
"페이지 캐싱 사용 시 after 필터가 실행되기 전에 페이지가 캐시되던 버그가 수정되었습니다. "
"after 필터에서 응답 헤더를 추가하거나 응답 본문을 변경하면 이제 올바르게 캐시됩니다."

#: ../../source/changelogs/v4.2.2.rst:19
msgid ""
"Due to a bug fix, now :php:func:`random_string()` with the first "
"parameter ``'crypto'`` throws ``InvalidArgumentException`` if the second "
"parameter ``$len`` is an odd number."
msgstr ""
"버그 수정으로 인해, 이제 첫 번째 파라미터가 ``'crypto'``\ 인 :php:func:`random_string()`\ 은 "
"두 번째 파라미터 ``$len``\ 이 홀수인 경우 ``InvalidArgumentException``\ 을 발생시킵니다."

#: ../../source/changelogs/v4.2.2.rst:22
msgid "Message Changes"
msgstr "메시지 변경"

#: ../../source/changelogs/v4.2.2.rst:24
msgid "Fixed ``invalidRoute`` message in ``Language/en/HTTP.php``."
msgstr "``Language/en/HTTP.php``\ 의 ``invalidRoute`` 메시지가 수정되었습니다."

#: ../../source/changelogs/v4.2.2.rst:27
msgid "Changes"
msgstr "변경 사항"

#: ../../source/changelogs/v4.2.2.rst:29
msgid ""
"Fixed: ``BaseBuilder::increment()`` and ``BaseBuilder::decrement()`` do "
"not reset the ``BaseBuilder`` state after a query."
msgstr "수정: ``BaseBuilder::increment()``\ 와 ``BaseBuilder::decrement()``\ 가 쿼리 후 ``BaseBuilder`` 상태를 초기화하지 않는 문제."

#: ../../source/changelogs/v4.2.2.rst:30
msgid "Fixed: Validation of fields with a leading asterisk (wildcard)."
msgstr "수정: 앞에 별표(와일드카드)가 있는 필드의 유효성 검사."

#: ../../source/changelogs/v4.2.2.rst:31
msgid "Now ``CLIRequest::isCLI()`` always returns true."
msgstr "이제 ``CLIRequest::isCLI()``\ 가 항상 true를 반환합니다."

#: ../../source/changelogs/v4.2.2.rst:32
msgid "Now ``IncommingRequest::isCLI()`` always returns false."
msgstr "이제 ``IncommingRequest::isCLI()``\ 가 항상 false를 반환합니다."

#: ../../source/changelogs/v4.2.2.rst:33
msgid ""
"**Vagrantfile.dist** has been moved to `CodeIgniter DevKit "
"<https://github.com/codeigniter4/devkit>`_."
msgstr "**Vagrantfile.dist**\ 가 `CodeIgniter DevKit <https://github.com/codeigniter4/devkit>`_\ 으로 이동되었습니다."

#: ../../source/changelogs/v4.2.2.rst:36
msgid "Deprecations"
msgstr "사용 중단"

#: ../../source/changelogs/v4.2.2.rst:38
msgid "The parameters of ``Services::request()`` are deprecated."
msgstr "``Services::request()``\ 의 파라미터가 사용 중단되었습니다."

#: ../../source/changelogs/v4.2.2.rst:39
msgid ""
"The first parameter ``$cacheConfig`` of ``CodeIgniter::gatherOutput()`` "
"is deprecated."
msgstr "``CodeIgniter::gatherOutput()``\ 의 첫 번째 파라미터 ``$cacheConfig``\ 가 사용 중단되었습니다."

#: ../../source/changelogs/v4.2.2.rst:40
msgid ""
"The second parameter ``$ifNotExists`` of ``Forge::_createTable()`` is "
"deprecated."
msgstr "``Forge::_createTable()``\ 의 두 번째 파라미터 ``$ifNotExists``\ 가 사용 중단되었습니다."

#: ../../source/changelogs/v4.2.2.rst:43
msgid "Bugs Fixed"
msgstr "버그 수정"

#: ../../source/changelogs/v4.2.2.rst:45
msgid ""
"See the repo's `CHANGELOG_4.2.md "
"<https://github.com/codeigniter4/CodeIgniter4/blob/develop/changelogs/CHANGELOG_4.2.md>`_"
" for a complete list of bugs fixed."
msgstr ""
"수정된 버그의 전체 목록은 저장소의 `CHANGELOG_4.2.md "
"<https://github.com/codeigniter4/CodeIgniter4/blob/develop/changelogs/CHANGELOG_4.2.md>`_\ 을 참조하십시오."
